{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, grab it, check properties, move to destination, perform specific task. Otherwise, avoid obstacles and move randomly.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />     <Action ID = GrabObject    />     <SubTree ID = ObjectProperties    />     <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />     <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    />     <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = MoveRandomly    />",
